<div dir=3D"ltr">We already have &quot;SHOULD support key exchange with X25=
519&quot; in this section, so people implementing it should have no problem=
s with adopting <a href=3D"https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-irtf-cfrg-curv=
es-10#section-6.2">X448</a> to achieve ~224 bit security where it&#39;s nee=
ded (and better performance than P-384).<br><div class=3D"gmail_extra"><br>=
<div class=3D"gmail_quote">On Mon, Oct 12, 2015 at 11:01 AM, John Mattsson =
<span dir=3D"ltr">&lt;<a href=3D"mailto:john.mattsson@ericsson.com" target=
=3D"_blank">john.mattsson@ericsson.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote=
